{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scientist needs your help to pack for a conference trip, but be sure not to pack any hot items next to any meltable items, nor any liquid containers next to any electronics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family needs your help to pack their rucksacks for a camping trip, but the childrens' plushies are very picky about who and what they're packed near!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rock musician needs your :-- well, you get the idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpacked is a logic puzzle game about efficiently packing items into grid-based inventories while satisfying their various constraints. Think &quot;Tetris meets Sudoku&quot;. Pack luggage while satisfying logical constraints, across <strong>61 handcrafted levels</strong>, featuring 4 quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/2e1a04e6f3f6d57b71807383ef8336c9.poster.avif?t=1774438320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/2e1a04e6f3f6d57b71807383ef8336c9.webm?t=1774438320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/2e1a04e6f3f6d57b71807383ef8336c9.mp4?t=1774438320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus an easy-to-use realtime <strong>level editor and Steam Workshop support</strong> to create and share an endless number of user generated levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/1568cb58891cbf7b054a9c4a7f7c3e73.poster.avif?t=1774438320\" width=1170 height=6