 game about efficiently packing items into grid-based inventories while satisfying their various constraints. Think &quot;Tetris meets Sudoku&quot;. Pack luggage while satisfying logical constraints, across <strong>61 handcrafted levels</strong>, featuring 4 quirky characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/2e1a04e6f3f6d57b71807383ef8336c9.poster.avif?t=1774438320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/2e1a04e6f3f6d57b71807383ef8336c9.webm?t=1774438320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/2e1a04e6f3f6d57b71807383ef8336c9.mp4?t=1774438320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus an easy-to-use realtime <strong>level editor and Steam Workshop support</strong> to create and share an endless number of user generated levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/1568cb58891cbf7b054a9c4a7f7c3e73.poster.avif?t=1774438320\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/1568cb58891cbf7b054a9c4a7f7c3e73.webm?t=1774438320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012320/extras/1568cb58891cbf7b054a9c4a7f7c3e73.mp4?t=1774438320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Antikythera Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store